"wow": "<b>Spooky Mary.</b> Move your whole hand so the thumb sits on A, two keys down from C, and play the song with the same fingers. Same song, new house: it turns dark and minor. Your first spooky music.",
"trick": "Your teacher plays the song with one wrong note. Put up your hand when you hear it, then find it on the page.",
